#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Transpile using `MidCircuitMeasure` {#transpile-using-midcircuitmeasure}"
msgstr ""
"Transpilar usando `MidCircuitMeasure` {#transpile-using-midcircuitmeasure}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`MidCircuitMeasure` is an addition to the available measurement operations, "
"calibrated specifically to perform [mid-circuit "
"measurements](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits#midcircuit). The "
"`MidCircuitMeasure` instruction maps to the `measure_2` instruction "
"supported by the backends. Note that `measure_2` is not supported on all "
"backends. You can use `service.backends(filters=lambda b: \"measure_2\" in "
"b.supported_instructions)` to find backends that support it. Here, we show "
"how to transpile the circuit so that the mid-circuit measurements defined in"
" the circuit are executed using the `MidCircuitMeasure` operation, if the "
"backend supports it.\n"
msgstr ""
"`MidCircuitMeasure` es una adición a las operaciones de medición "
"disponibles, calibrada específicamente para realizar [mediciones a mitad de "
"circuito](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits#midcircuit). La instrucción "
"`MidCircuitMeasure` se mapea a la instrucción `measure_2` soportada por los "
"backends. Ten en cuenta que `measure_2` no es compatible con todos los "
"backends. Puedes usar `service.backends(filters=lambda b: \"measure_2\" in "
"b.supported_instructions)` para encontrar backends que la soporten. Aquí, "
"mostramos cómo transpilar el circuito para que las mediciones a mitad de "
"circuito definidas en el circuito se ejecuten usando la operación "
"`MidCircuitMeasure`, si el backend la soporta.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
